WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:04.560
There are lots of good reasons
to try and follow a healthier diet—

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:06.640
you lose weight,
you feel good,

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:08.440
but the main reason?

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:13.000
To live a longer, happier,
more productive life.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.040
Welcome to the
NutritionFacts Podcast.

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:18.120
I’m your host,
Dr. Michael Greger.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:22.000
Did you know that taking human
growth hormone somatotropin

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.640
may actually accelerate
the aging process?

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:26.520
Here’s our first story.

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:29.480
Of all the anti-aging
clinic scams,

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:32.720
the selling and administration
of human growth hormone

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:35.280
has been called
"perhaps the most blatant

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:38.720
and organized form
of quackery today."

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:41.400
It all started,
promisingly enough,

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:42.840
with a small trial published

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:44.840
in the New England
Journal of Medicine

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:46.720
in which 12 men
over the age of 60

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:49.640
who got injections
of growth hormone

00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:52.920
gained eight pounds of lean mass
over a period of six months,

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:55.960
compared to nine guys
who weren't injected.

00:00:55.960 --> 00:00:59.400
Newspapers around the world
heralded the results,

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:01.560
anti-aging clinics popped up

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:03.360
to offer the injections

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:06.840
for $4,700 per month or more,

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:08.720
and the popular press
churned out books

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:12.240
extolling the hormone's
age reversing properties.

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:14.840
After all, that's how much
muscle mass one might lose

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:17.840
over 10 to 20 years of aging.

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:19.680
That's assuming, though,

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:22.360
that what they gained
was muscle.

00:01:22.360 --> 00:01:24.000
The original study
didn't measure

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:25.800
muscle strength or performance,

00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:27.840
but larger, longer, and better,

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:29.960
i.e. placebo-controlled studies,

00:01:29.960 --> 00:01:33.720
subsequently did,
and found zero benefit.

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:36.640
A meta-analysis of studies
of growth hormone

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:38.560
for athletic performance
found that

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:42.880
it may even worsen
exercise capacity.

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:46.200
Wait, how can you gain
pounds of lean mass,

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:48.320
but not get any stronger?

00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:52.520
By retaining pounds of water.

00:01:52.520 --> 00:01:56.080
The lean mass was mostly
just due to fluid retention.

00:01:56.080 --> 00:01:59.080
In fact, obvious swelling,
soft tissue edema,

00:01:59.080 --> 00:02:02.280
is one of the most common
side effects of growth hormone,

00:02:02.280 --> 00:02:05.240
affecting about
half of recipients.

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:07.960
Other side effects include
joint aches,

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:09.360
carpal tunnel syndrome,

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:11.320
male breast development,

00:02:11.320 --> 00:02:12.720
elevated blood sugars,

00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:16.000
and new-onset diabetes.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:20.000
All this with no evidence
of anti-aging effects.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:22.640
If anything,
growth hormone may actually

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:25.360
accelerate the aging process.

00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:27.640
For example,
those with acromegaly,

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:29.920
a disease
of excess growth hormone,

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:33.400
suffer disproportionately
from muscle weakness,

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:36.800
as well as diabetes,
high blood pressure,

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:38.400
artery dysfunction,

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:41.040
and bone loss.

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:43.760
In the 1980s,
doctors and parents

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:47.160
conspired to inject short kids
with growth hormone

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:49.480
to try to make them grow taller.

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:51.240
What happened to them?

00:02:51.240 --> 00:02:53.240
A study following
thousands of children

00:02:53.240 --> 00:02:55.720
who were injected decades ago
with growth hormone,

00:02:55.720 --> 00:02:57.520
for one reason or another,

00:02:57.520 --> 00:03:01.080
found they had
a 33 percent increased risk

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:03.760
of being dead,

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:07.480
largely from brain bleeds
and tumors.

00:03:07.480 --> 00:03:10.800
The strokes would make sense
from blood pressure elevation,

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:12.480
and the malignancies

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:14.560
from the growth hormone-
induced rise

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:17.760
of the cancer-promoting
growth hormone IGF-1.

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:19.800
20,000 to 30,000 people
in the U.S.

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:21.640
are estimated
to use growth hormone

00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:24.200
in a vain attempt
to combat aging,

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:27.800
a practice referred to in
a leading endocrinology journal

00:03:27.800 --> 00:03:32.720
as a "medical fraud
of unprecedented proportions."

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:35.680
Given the adverse effects,
maybe it's good

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:38.680
that all the tested samples
of human growth hormone,

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:40.480
also known as somatotropin,

00:03:40.480 --> 00:03:43.080
sourced from online pharmacies
were found to have

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:45.800
a fraction
of the labelled amount,

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:49.240
presumably due to degradation
from improper storage,

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:52.360
and the majority of samples
confiscated in another study

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:56.000
were counterfeit
and contained none at all.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:58.040
There's also
a proliferation of pills

00:03:58.040 --> 00:04:01.320
and nasal
or sublingual spray forms

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:03.440
that makes no biological sense,

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:06.000
as the hormone
is too large a protein

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:08.520
to effectively cross membranes,
and if swallowed,

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:10.880
is simply destroyed
in the stomach.

00:04:10.880 --> 00:04:12.240
Given the risk of cancer

00:04:12.240 --> 00:04:14.880
and potential
for a shortened lifespan,

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:17.880
one prominent clinician remarked
that maybe growth hormone

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:20.920
is a "true anti-aging drug"

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:23.400
in that it may
prematurely stop you

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:26.080
from growing any older.

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:27.040
In our next story,

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:31.800
we look at how DHEA levels
naturally decline with age.

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:37.040
So, does replenishing youthful
levels have restorative effects?

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:40.880
Dehydroepiandrosterone, DHEA,

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.960
is the most abundant
steroid hormone

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:44.440
circulating in the blood,

00:04:44.440 --> 00:04:47.520
or rather, prohormone.

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:49.940
It's produced largely
by the adrenal glands

00:04:49.940 --> 00:04:52.320
and is then
converted locally in tissues

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:54.640
into androgens,
male sex hormones,

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:57.840
or estrogens,
female sex hormones.

00:04:57.840 --> 00:05:00.160
DHEA production in the body

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:03.560
peaks between the ages
of 25 to 35,

00:05:03.560 --> 00:05:05.880
and then gradually
starts to decline

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:08.800
about 2 percent every year.

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:12.760
By one's 80s, DHEA production
is down about 80 percent

00:05:12.760 --> 00:05:15.480
from peak values
in early adulthood.

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:18.000
Cross-sectional studies
found a link

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.840
between low DHEA levels

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:22.720
and impaired sexual function,

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:24.840
less vitality,

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:26.720
depressed mood,

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:29.080
lower bone mineral density,

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:31.120
and compromised
cognitive performance

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:32.840
in terms of executive function,

00:05:32.840 --> 00:05:35.440
concentration, and memory.

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:37.680
Combined with
interventional studies

00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:40.000
done on rodents
showing a wide range

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:43.000
of beneficial effects,
DHEA was heralded

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:47.640
as an "anti-aging
superhormone panacea,"

00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:49.960
even though
rodent adrenal glands

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:51.960
don't even produce the stuff.

00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:54.640
But U.S. DHEA sales grew

00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:57.280
to more than $50 million a year

00:05:57.280 --> 00:06:00.600
on the premise that
replenishing youthful levels

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:03.560
might have restorative effects.

00:06:03.560 --> 00:06:07.600
Given the Premarin debacle
with estrogen replacement,

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:11.360
showing that the reversing
of age-related hormonal decline

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:13.920
can sometimes
do more harm than good,

00:06:13.920 --> 00:06:16.800
clinical trials
were desperately needed.

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:20.040
But because DHEA
can't be patented,

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:21.640
there's been
little research interest

00:06:21.640 --> 00:06:24.600
among drug companies
to study it.

00:06:24.600 --> 00:06:27.080
In fact,
part of its mass appeal is that,

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:30.840
due to a legal loophole,
DHEA is the only steroid

00:06:30.840 --> 00:06:33.160
that's not considered
a controlled substance,

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:36.400
and therefore is available
over the counter

00:06:36.400 --> 00:06:39.040
as a "dietary supplement,"

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:41.840
rather than
a prescription only drug.

00:06:41.840 --> 00:06:44.000
Thankfully,
a series of long-term,

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:46.320
high-quality randomized
controlled trials

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:49.560
started to be published
within the last 20 years,

00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:52.600
and early enthusiasm
was replaced

00:06:52.600 --> 00:06:54.760
by a sober skepticism

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:58.720
as the "panacea"
repeatedly failed

00:06:58.720 --> 00:07:01.000
to beat the placebo.

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:03.560
The promised
DHEA fountain of youth

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:05.240
was drying up.

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:08.440
A review of about two dozen
randomized controlled trials

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:11.400
of oral DHEA
in postmenopausal women

00:07:11.400 --> 00:07:13.320
failed to find evidence
of improvements

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:14.760
in sexual function,

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:16.320
psychological well-being,

00:07:16.320 --> 00:07:18.600
or cognitive performance.

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:22.280
However, there may be a role
for intravaginal DHEA

00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:24.320
for vaginal atrophy,

00:07:24.320 --> 00:07:26.080
which I covered before.

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:28.520
A meta-analysis
of about two dozen

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:33.200
randomized controlled trials
of DHEA in elderly men

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:36.520
similarly found no evidence
of benefits for metabolism,

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:39.720
bone health, sexual function,
or quality of life,

00:07:39.720 --> 00:07:43.240
nor does there seem to be
a cognitive benefit.

00:07:43.240 --> 00:07:45.760
The only benefit found in men

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:49.640
was a relatively trivial drop
in body fat compared to placebo,

00:07:49.640 --> 00:07:52.920
less than one pound over a span
of eight months.

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:54.160
But in women,

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:57.360
DHEA may benefit fertility.

00:07:57.360 --> 00:08:00.240
Fertility in women
starts declining gradually

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:02.520
but significantly at age 32,

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:05.080
but then more rapidly
after age 37,

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:08.120
but DHEA may help.

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:10.600
Side-effects
of taking DHEA supplements

00:08:10.600 --> 00:08:13.600
include acne,
oily skin and hair,

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:16.040
and an increase in body hair
and blood levels

00:08:16.040 --> 00:08:19.680
of the cancer-promoting
growth hormone IGF-1.

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:21.360
As with any supplement,
there are concerns

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:23.600
about quality control issues.

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:26.200
Some so-called
"DHEA" supplements

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:27.720
just blatantly lie

00:08:27.720 --> 00:08:30.520
and have no DHEA whatsoever,

00:08:30.520 --> 00:08:34.320
or up to, like,
150 percent of the listed dose.

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:35.720
For these and other reasons,

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:39.440
DHEA supplements
are not recommended.

00:08:39.440 --> 00:08:42.680
Are there natural ways
to boost DHEA,

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:45.600
for example,
for the fertility benefit?

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:48.880
Lower protein intake is
associated with higher levels,

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:53.040
and an interventional trial
found increasing fiber intake

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:54.840
actively raised levels,

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:57.320
so what about
putting them together?

00:08:57.320 --> 00:09:01.600
Enter: "Short-Term Impact
of a Lactovegetarian Diet."

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:04.680
After just five days
on an egg-free vegetarian diet,

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:07.200
blood levels
of the DHEA precursor rose

00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:08.920
nearly 20 percent.

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:10.840
Or you can do it the other way:

00:09:10.840 --> 00:09:13.200
Take those already eating
a plant-based diet

00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:15.720
and switch them
to a conventional diet,

00:09:15.720 --> 00:09:19.280
and their DHEA drops
up to nearly 20 percent.

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:21.080
The bodies of those
eating plant-based

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:23.840
appear to hold onto
the hormone better,

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:26.080
less urinary excretion,

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:30.513
which is normally something
you only see in fasting.

